Hanumān beholds crowned jeweled Rāvaṇa on crystal throne --- Hanumān sees ten heads massive arms and moon face --- Hanumān sees chowrie women and counselors around Rāvaṇa --- Hanumān marvels at Rāvaṇa form courage and splendor --- Hanumān deems Rāvaṇa fit to guard gods but for adharma --- Hanumān fears Rāvaṇa could make world one ocean